    rdfs:label "Evidence for Train or Blubber (Whale Oils) used in Leather Tanning, Tawing & Currying: Mortimer (1823), General Commercial Dictionary, scan p. 229"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "Cod-oil is applied to nearly the same purposes as whale-oil: it is much used by curriers, and is a good lamp-oil. COFFEE. (GER. Koffe, Koffebohnen."@en ;
